      "text": "METROBASE Traffic Update as of 5:00pm\n\nWHEN: April 05, 2026\n\nA. MAJOR ROADS:\n\n*EDSA\nSOUTHBOUND \n- Timog to Santolan, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Ortigas to Shaw blvd, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Ayala to Magallanes, moderate to slow moving (due to road closure at EDSA Magallanes ramp to Pasay all vehicles take SLEX ramp / Chino Roces)\n\nNORTHBOUND.\n- Park Ave. to Taft Ave., moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n- Madison to Megamall, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Santolan to Aurora Blvd, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n\n*C5\nSOUTHBOUND\n- CP Garcia, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Xavierville Ave. to Aurora blvd, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n\nNORTHBOUND:\n-Lanuza, moderate (due to volume of vehicles) \n- Calle Industria, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n- Bonny Serrano, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n- Ateneo, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n\n*COMMONWEALTH\nEASTBOUND:\n- Malboro street, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\nWESTBOUND:\n- Atherton, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\n*QUEZON AVENUE\nEASTBOUND:\n- Delta, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Sct.Albano to EDSA, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\nWESTBOUND:\n- Sen.Miriam Defensor Santiago to EDSA svc rd.,, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Delta, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\n*MARCOS HIGHWAY\nEASTBOUND:\n- Light traffic\n\nWESTBOUND:\n- Light traffic\n\n*ORTIGAS AVENUE\nEASTBOUND:\n- Santolan, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n- Meralco Ave., moderate (due to volume of vehicles) \n- CCF to Rosario, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\nWESTBOUND\n- Corinthians to EDSA, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Santolan, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\n*ROXAS BOULEVARD\nSOUTHBOUND:\n- Katigbak Prkwy.,moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Quirino Ave., moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Airport road, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n- Coastal, moderate (due to volume of vehicles)\n\nNORTHBOUND:\n- P.Ocampo to Quirino Ave., moderate (due to volume of vehicles)\n- United Nations Ave., moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n- Luneta to Padre Burgos, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\n*TAFT AVENUE\nSOUTHBOUND:\n- Luneta to Kalaw Ave., moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n- Quirino Ave., moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n- Buendia Ave., moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n- EDSA, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n\nNORTHBOUND:\n- EDSA, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Buendia, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- P. Ocampo, moderate (due to volume of vehicles) \n- Quirino Ave., moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n\n#mmda",
